            <ArticleTitle>Hematopoietic Stem Cell Transplantation: Stress, Psychoneurologic Symptoms, and Coping Strategies in Adolescents and Young Adults .</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>531-533</MedlinePgn>
